    <item>
      <title>Evolution of GPI and Cartridge Web: Key Milestones</title>
      <link>https://mis3085.github.io/docs-cartridgeweb/en/corporate-profile/milestone/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://mis3085.github.io/docs-cartridgeweb/en/corporate-profile/milestone/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Company Journey: Major Milestones and Achievements 
    &lt;div id=&#34;company-journey-major-milestones-and-achievements&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#company-journey-major-milestones-and-achievements&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;1978 - 1989 
    &lt;div id=&#34;1978---1989&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#1978---1989&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1978&lt;/strong&gt;: General Plastic Industrial Co., Ltd. (GPI) was established by Chairman Mr. Jack Wang.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1986&lt;/strong&gt;: The company expanded into plastic molding production, focusing on toner cartridges for copiers and printers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;1990 - 1999 
    &lt;div id=&#34;1990---1999&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#1990---1999&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1995&lt;/strong&gt;: A second manufacturing plant was set up, increasing the number of production lines to seven.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1996&lt;/strong&gt;: Initiated ISO 9002 implementation to enhance quality management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1997&lt;/strong&gt;: Achieved ISO 9002 certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1998&lt;/strong&gt;: Continued efforts to improve quality through ISO 9002 processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1999&lt;/strong&gt;: Developed and successfully introduced OPC drum bases to the market, establishing advanced manufacturing and development capabilities for complex OPC bases. Upgraded gears to JIS4 standards. In October, GPI developed precision gears with a 60mm outside diameter for copiers and began mass production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;2000 - 2009 
    &lt;div id=&#34;2000---2009&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#2000---2009&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2000&lt;/strong&gt;: The company name was officially changed to General Plastic Industrial Co., Ltd. in April. In May, GPI issued stocks, and by August, total capital increased to 9.7 million USD.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2001&lt;/strong&gt;: Shares were listed on the OTC market (Code: 6128).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2002&lt;/strong&gt;: In April, mass production began for the first model of complex &amp;ldquo;All in one&amp;rdquo; laser printer toner cartridges, with several additional models developed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2003&lt;/strong&gt;: Shares transitioned to listing on the TWSE.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2006&lt;/strong&gt;: Total capital increased to 22.6 million USD.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2008&lt;/strong&gt;: The Cartridge Web brand was created to serve the finished goods wholesale market for printer toner cartridges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2009&lt;/strong&gt;: The &amp;ldquo;Cartridge Web&amp;rdquo; brand was further developed, seeking regional distributors and wholesalers. Total capital increased to 47.5 million USD.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div id=&#34;gallery-c43e3ebb0395e2345e812b3c70fb600e&#34; class=&#34;gallery&#34;&gt;
  
  
    
    
&lt;figure class=&#34;grid-w50 pb-4 text-center&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://mis3085.github.io/docs-cartridgeweb/1997_3436324456320725348.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;ISO 9002 certified in 1997&#34; class=&#34;mx-auto max-w-full h-auto&#34;/&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;ISO 9002 certified in 1997&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;figure class=&#34;grid-w50 pb-4 text-center&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://mis3085.github.io/docs-cartridgeweb/2008_14240109973811854038.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Cartridge Web brand launch in 2008&#34; class=&#34;mx-auto max-w-full h-auto&#34;/&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Cartridge Web brand launch in 2008&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;


&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;2010 - Present 
    &lt;div id=&#34;2010---present&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#2010---present&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2010&lt;/strong&gt;: Construction began on a hotel building in the Taichung Harbor region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2012&lt;/strong&gt;: Achieved ISO 14001 certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2013&lt;/strong&gt;: Grand opening of the Taichung Harbor Hotel in March.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2018&lt;/strong&gt;: Completed 100% acquisition of Katun Holdings LP, the world’s largest distributor of aftermarket imaging supplies. Capital was further increased by cash.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2021&lt;/strong&gt;: Achieved ISO 13485 certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div id=&#34;gallery-b210d77dac625bd3a3383d95733fb770&#34; class=&#34;gallery&#34;&gt;
  
  
    
    
    
