&lt;figure class=&#34;grid-w50 pb-4 text-center&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://mis3085.github.io/docs-cartridgeweb/2013_10855019410710261077.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Taichung Harbor Hotel grand opening in 2013&#34; class=&#34;mx-auto max-w-full h-auto&#34;/&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Taichung Harbor Hotel grand opening in 2013&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
